    {
      "type": "examAlert",
      "items": [
        "Kwashiorkor is caused specifically by protein deficiency, while Marasmus results from a severe deficiency of both proteins and calories.",
        "Vitamin C (Ascorbic Acid) is water-soluble and easily destroyed by heat during cooking.",
        "Deficiency of Vitamin D causes Rickets in children and Osteomalacia in adults.",
        "Iodine deficiency causes Goitre, while Iron deficiency leads to Anaemia."
      ],
